ely commits to recording in provenance). A dialect claim about a specific external file should be observed from the file, not inferred from the source description.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fa1a160d63b095e95","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Context paragraph (\"Validate it offline with the existing Draft-07-capable `jsonschema` dependency\") and AC line \"`.gitlab-ci.yml` validates offline against GitLab's Draft-07 ... ci.json pinned at commit 776c20ad...\"","norm_id":"n3d245fabcb2a6ae6","priority":0.0,"reason":"default-advisory","scenarios":["The vendored ci.json at 776c20ad declares a $schema other than Draft-07 (e.g. draft-2020-12); Draft7Validator would then be validating under the wrong dialect semantics"],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"In the schema-validation step, read the `$schema` key from the vendored file, assert it matches the Draft-07 URI (and matches the committed provenance `dialect`), then instantiate `jsonschema.validators.Draft7Validator`; fail the contract test if the observed dialect differs from the recorded/expected one.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"insufficient","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"non